{"title":"2018 AIME I Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Official_MAA)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Official MAA)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_5\">Problem 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For each ordered pair of real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/3/e53b1fe25be1c679117fb44a6a886fe1247d189a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" /> satisfying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/b/afbbbda1a46f1a5797bb4174fb377e1ec8497dd4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_2(2x+y) = \\log_4(x^2+xy+7y^2)\\]\" width=\"272\" height=\"20\" />there is a real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb064112b6c94470339f6571f69d07afc1c024c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/d/36dbe8d0f02bf52e0f19883df3d2014ef023bbad.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_3(3x+y) = \\log_9(3x^2+4xy+Ky^2).\\]\" width=\"303\" height=\"19\" />Find the product of all possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb064112b6c94470339f6571f69d07afc1c024c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the logarithmic property <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/c/a1cf2e336ed40eb1a445a22b4e667a04eb5cd799.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{a^n}b^n = \\log_{a}b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"128\" height=\"19\" />, we note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/c/e1c122d9555037c0bcd9812250e6a7d551dfeea7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(2x+y)^2 = x^2+xy+7y^2\\]\" width=\"202\" height=\"20\" />\nThat gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/2/4b27dbe20dec99c19c0f3df3665bb4142c499cd4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2+xy-2y^2=0\\]\" width=\"140\" height=\"19\" /> upon simplification and division by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Factoring <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/2/c8209d492396bf687a0c118f7e4a38512172dcc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+xy-2y^2=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"141\" height=\"18\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/a/33a99f10c96c60bfe2d9eed191280893b5191474.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x+2y)(x-y)=0\\]\" width=\"153\" height=\"18\" /> Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/4/8c4d5bada321428d4b0d667bd273bf712c5fe1c3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=y \\text{ or }x=-2y\\]\" width=\"136\" height=\"15\" />\nFrom the second equation, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/5/6b5a5abadd34896754376e3307cd4048c8c2e4f6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[9x^2+6xy+y^2=3x^2+4xy+Ky^2\\]\" width=\"274\" height=\"19\" /> If we take <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/1/0110f1bb04c51b2a4d431bf14489fc1b48b37421.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"11\" />, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/0/6d0a919859dc04f32e68538121af23cd51221cde.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K=9$\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" />. If we take <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/3/b935e5f3b04844a89b951fd234c6bae8a7c524a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"66\" height=\"15\" />, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/9/129a8a16ef30011d8114642b7bede2a8d907dc8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K=21$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" />. The product is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/6/5f6e0661a44414a3402587cfabb8010925e9d117.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{189}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>-expiLnCalc\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Do as done in Solution 1 to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/2/4b27dbe20dec99c19c0f3df3665bb4142c499cd4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2+xy-2y^2=0\\]\" width=\"140\" height=\"19\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/d/c1d316a6cbf2dad48ff4ffbf35189300c35d3bd9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies (\\frac{x}{y})^2+\\frac{x}{y}-2=0\\]\" width=\"175\" height=\"36\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/f/ddfd9be21aab4a2540a563b3ad23fb5c3c5aba62.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies \\frac{x}{y}=\\frac{-1\\pm\\sqrt{1+8}}{2}=1,-2\\]\" width=\"246\" height=\"43\" /> Do as done in Solution 1 to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/5/6b5a5abadd34896754376e3307cd4048c8c2e4f6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[9x^2+6xy+y^2=3x^2+4xy+Ky^2\\]\" width=\"274\" height=\"19\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/2/012b1f561cb424eccff4381fcfea1ef4280ac880.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies 6x^2+2xy+(1-K)y^2=0\\]\" width=\"250\" height=\"20\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/5/305ac646cb08a3d414a51b92a170716472a0756b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies 6(\\frac{x}{y})^2+2\\frac{x}{y}+(1-K)=0\\]\" width=\"246\" height=\"36\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/5/9f5b4bfad285ee05d93050463c7932a3883d64d4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies \\frac{x}{y}=\\frac{-2\\pm \\sqrt{4-24(1-K)}}{12}\\]\" width=\"254\" height=\"44\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/1/7314453f951beaee5a91c13ae73e9ebe8983085f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies \\frac{x}{y}=\\frac{-2\\pm 2\\sqrt{6K-5}}{12}=\\frac{-1\\pm \\sqrt{6K-5}}{6}\\]\" width=\"352\" height=\"44\" />If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/0/1b0a25df91937164e14a2c6445eeb41895e2eb3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{y}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"46\" height=\"36\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/6/4f60f7badf72f1f55507c756fc43328e5ecd637d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1=\\frac{-1\\pm \\sqrt{6K-5}}{6}\\]\" width=\"152\" height=\"40\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/7/e37202e77c4615b682881ba0b6da2568a1696141.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies 6=-1\\pm \\sqrt{6K-5}\\]\" width=\"190\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/7/307cc42bf71e42368e0a921b8cefb7942580108b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies 7=\\pm \\sqrt{6K-5}\\]\" width=\"158\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/9/7b988ff9d61e59dd1766d0e96e0b09d2229b62b0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies 49=6K-5\\]\" width=\"137\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/4/504b630d771fb9fe7d765f801c57a4a0e2e5f1b1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies K=9\\]\" width=\"88\" height=\"13\" />If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/1/5311beccbcddacc9ca8e6de5e24bd6f889cc9d89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{y}=-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"64\" height=\"38\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/5/11530ccd4d514263cc323b5ae2d5b2aa8d860c03.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-2=\\frac{-1\\pm \\sqrt{6K-5}}{6}\\]\" width=\"166\" height=\"40\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/6/b4694135b009af981ae0dea73279fe06106b9e57.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies -12=-1\\pm \\sqrt{6K-5}\\]\" width=\"213\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/e/5fe0ee1e33d130124c7936682721d5a828d182f6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies -11=\\sqrt{6K-5}\\]\" width=\"167\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/0/690e2ba1ab73a5d20ded4c1c51a354b4136b607b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies 121=6K-5\\]\" width=\"146\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/c/8fc9e30b412d8ffa29f9f4e40e397ec846567a39.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies 126=6K\\]\" width=\"115\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/a/f8a1a4ab02fdeae6200f08755b5bbc4032e4540d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies K=21\\]\" width=\"96\" height=\"13\" />Hence our final answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf05735df4ff726185f712090eb3c81c03fe01a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21\\cdot 9=\\boxed{189}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"103\" height=\"23\" />\n-vsamc<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/1/25175d0e269ed8d27eef5420fe041de8f3941aa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\newline$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"22\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Official_MAA.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Official_MAA)\">Solution 3 (Official MAA)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Official MAA)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/4/154fc33e2c7a2213d6a4b3d04e0cf82179d54d15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+xy+7y^2=\\left(x+\\tfrac{y}{2}\\right)^2+\\tfrac{27}{4}y^2&gt;0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"294\" height=\"25\" /> the right side of the first equation is real. It follows that the left side of the equation is also real, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/b/debae10cffcbbf41f813cc36543c4b0e1ed7229a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x+y&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/5/0757b375bc1db0a467872e50d4cf6bc33542e230.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_2(2x+y)=\\log_{2^2}(2x+y)^2=\\log_4(4x^2+4xy+y^2).\\]\" width=\"420\" height=\"19\" /> Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/c/34c81b31ae23f452459d161e4a845ec151e4f218.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2+4xy+y^2=x^2+xy+7y^2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"254\" height=\"18\" /> which implies that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/d/a7da8c85a934ed421e26cfc7dae6b65a7527e7f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0=x^2+xy-2y^2=(x+2y)(x-y).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"295\" height=\"21\" /> Therefore either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/3/b935e5f3b04844a89b951fd234c6bae8a7c524a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"66\" height=\"15\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/a/f5a7888da2fab10f8ec0b87127f80f9bf5e7a69a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=y,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"48\" height=\"11\" /> and because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/d/71d006de8d783ff692aaf05ae22cc933729b4456.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x+y&gt;0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"88\" height=\"16\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> must be positive and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/7/8071ee70f1688dcaa6480d423173afb4b804f736.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x+y=x+(2x+y)&gt;0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"210\" height=\"18\" /> Similarly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/4/e5495be6c87971b758d99c78234389f417633311.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_3(3x+y)=\\log_{3^2}(3x+y)^2=\\log_9(9x^2+6xy+y^2).\\]\" width=\"420\" height=\"19\" /> If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/b/d9bc1b80d24787544f64785a1326de44a8156840.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-2y\\ne 0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"104\" height=\"17\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/4/b44ac7a4a5c456754df0e696ef988e687b2853cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9x^2+6xy+y^2=36y^2-12y^2+y^2=25y^2=3x^2+4xy+Ky^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"490\" height=\"18\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/f/b4f7fe11843d578946a30748f153fb9aca4a56ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K=21.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"62\" height=\"13\" /> If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/a/3aadb35cda69805545eeafb71bc24fb7a004a767.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=y\\ne 0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"81\" height=\"17\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/8/2f8482ea2fa103d1932d99b6b6212d69c091f073.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9x^2+6xy+y^2=16y^2=3x^2+4xy+Ky^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"334\" height=\"18\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/3/5b31e71c88f23bd58f911f6234b46edbaee2220c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K=9.$\" width=\"53\" height=\"12\" /> The requested product is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/2/c82b6d2975e1e3966ccf2749d015004b4a46f830.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21\\cdot9=189.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"95\" height=\"13\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I\" title=\"2018 AIME I\">2018 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2018 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2018 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2018\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2018 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2018 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2018 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2018 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2018 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2018 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2018 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2018 AIME I Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2018 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2018 AIME I Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2018 AIME I Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2018 AIME I Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2018 AIME I Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"